<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Bear Stearns ups paper/timber cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Bear Stearns ups paper/timber cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns confirmed it upgraded several paper and timber stocks to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- the stocks that were upgraded include Jefferson Smurfit Corp, Gaylord Container Corp, Georgia-Pacific Corp and Union Camp Corp.</p>
</text>
